- The `StoreLocal` arm of `src/react_compiler/optimization/constant_propagation.rs` gives the result temporary of the assignment the stored constant. The consumer folds to a `Primitive`, so nothing reads that temporary.
- `prune_unused_lvalues` then removes the lvalue of the store.
