Every <Trans> string silently disappears from the page while strings from the non-JSX t macro still render, so the breakage looks partial. The dev server does not apply the compiler, so this only appears in production builds.

Any tool whose output uses underscore-prefixed component bindings (macros, codegen, transpiled imports) hits the same problem.

